Bearer link + expiresIn: '7d' — entu-api ~/projects/entu-api, commit `82cb25b` (matches the pin cited in mvox-app issue #23's comment thread), `utils/entity.js:462-466`:
```
if (property.type === 'entu_user' && property.string) {
  const { jwtSecret } = useRuntimeConfig()
  property.invite = jwt.sign({ db: entu.account, entityId: entityId.toString() }, jwtSecret, { expiresIn: '7d' })
  delete property.string
}
```
The minted JWT payload carries only `{db, entityId}` — no email, no recipient identity. This is the 'bearer secret' issue #23 refers to.

